# Two defending snow lands reduce an attacking 0/2's power by two but its toughness only by one.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Snowblind
Snow-Covered Forest x2
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Snow-Covered Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Snow-Covered Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Snowblind.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareBlockers]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Snowblind.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
